part A: formula equals recursion at all 27 checks (x in 3/10, -1/2, 9/10; k = 0 to 8)
part B: x = 3/10, f(x) = 10/7 = 1.4285714286
part B: n =  0  P_n(x) = 1.0000000000  error = 0.4285714286
part B: n =  1  P_n(x) = 1.3000000000  error = 0.1285714286
part B: n =  2  P_n(x) = 1.3900000000  error = 0.0385714286
